        "statement": "Let a massive particle in a named inertial frame have constant mass $m>0$, speed $|v|\\le c/10$, Lorentz factor $\\gamma=(1-|v|^2/c^2)^{-1/2}$, observer energy $E=\\gamma mc^2$, and kinetic energy $T=E-mc^2$ as in [[pthm-rpm-inverse-momentum-and-work]]. Treat the speed bound as a stipulated state condition. Then\n\n$$0\\le T-\\frac12m|v|^2\\le\\frac{3m|v|^4}{8c^2(99/100)^{5/2}}.$$",
